                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "These 53ft dry van dimensions allow you to haul up to 26 standard pallets, depending on loading configuration. For many Florida-based carriers, this size offers the best balance between capacity and efficiency. It maximizes freight volume while staying compliant with federal and state regulations.",
